 nd the Bicentennial in 1976\, to town and state anniversaries\, people hav
 e commemorated through parades\, quilting bees\, reenactments and more. Vi
 sitors can learn more about national celebrations and how Fairfielders hav
 e remembered key moments in history through unique photographs\, quilts\, 
 costumes\, flags and more! On view June 13\, 2026 through November 8\, 202
 6\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events/happy-anniversary-centenary-celebr
 ations-beyond-exhibition
