BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pick Your Own Apples
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260919
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261019
DTSTAMP:20260925T154359Z
UID:94a39911a93ba439d2d55b615629@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Visit Staehly Farm Winery's Petticoat Lane orchards and pick y
 our own apples this fall. Our sprawling acreage at 23 Petticoat Lane inclu
 des a pick your own apple orchard as well as a hard cider tap room and har
 vest barn. Picking is available on Saturdays and Sundays in September and 
 October. Hours and days may vary with weather conditions. Apple varieties 
 include Honeycrisp\, Macoun\, Gala\, Crispin\, and more (availability depe
 ndent on weather conditions). Visit www.staehlys.com or call 860-873-9774 
 for updated field conditions and availability.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.
 com/events/pick-your-own-apples-0
LOCATION:Yankee Cider Barn\, 23 Petticoat Lane\, East Haddam CT\, 06423
URL:https://ctvisit.com/events/pick-your-own-apples-0
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Walktober 2026
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260919
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261109
DTSTAMP:20260925T154359Z
UID:f0975a1b427097c90589d5f9c323@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate the 36th Annual Walktober in The Last Green Val
 ley National Heritage Corridor from Sept. 19 to Nov. 8. Featuring more tha
 n 250 unique hikes\, bikes\, paddles\, events and more\, Walktober is full
  of adventures for all ages! Walktober is a celebration of one of the nati
 on's oldest National Heritage Corridors\, right here in Connecticut\, in o
 ur most colorful season. We have an online guide to help you choose your a
 dventures and a printed guide too. Just give us a call or an email and we 
 can help you get one of the printed guides.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com
 /events/walktober-2026
LOCATION:The Last Green Valley National Heritage Corridor\, 203B Main St.
 \, Danielson CT\, 06239
URL:https://ctvisit.com/events/walktober-2026
END:VEVENT
