BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Academy Players present: Tracy Letts’s The Minutes
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260926
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260927
DTSTAMP:20260925T154359Z
UID:3fe90dec6e4a982dbefc60e129a0@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Academy Players present Tracy Letts’s The Minutes Fairfield
 ’s faculty and staff theatre troupe\, the Academy Players\, presents The
  Minutes\, a darkly comic and sharply satirical play that follows a small-
 town council meeting that gradually exposes buried secrets\, civic corrupt
 ion\, and the dangerous myths communities uphold to preserve power and con
 trol. Each performance will be followed by a talk-back discussion led by F
 airfield University faculty.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events/academy
 -players-present-tracy-lettss-minutes
LOCATION:Quick Center for the Arts: Wien Experimental Theatre\, 1073 N Ben
 son Rd\, Fairfield CT\, 06824
URL:https://ctvisit.com/events/academy-players-present-tracy-lettss-minute
 s
END:VEVENT
