BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:I'M YOUR MAN: A Tribute to Leonard Cohen with Robert Burke Warren 
 & Friends
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260926
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260927
DTSTAMP:20260925T154359Z
UID:2f2175686f49ea0c0ad9396437ce@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Robert Burke Warren is a musician\, writer\, actor\, and teach
 er. His songs appear in movies\, television\, and on albums by Rosanne Cas
 h\, RuPaul\, and rockabilly queen Wanda Jackson. As a globetrotting bassis
 t in the pre-digital age\, he toured extensively in an Econoline van. In t
 he mid 90s\, he played Buddy Holly in the West End musical Buddy: the Budd
 y Holly Story. He produces and performs in I’m Your Man: A Tribute to Le
 onard Cohen\, The Bowie Birthday Bash\, and More Than the Man in Black: An
  Evening of Johnny Cash.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events/im-your-man
 -tribute-leonard-cohen-robert-burke-warren-friends
